Omission
- [N1] Omitted trace (input 1): i1:For TS recruitment, the first step is to advise unsuccessful candidates. -> i3:if the terms and conditions of the offer for a candidate need to be sorted out, it is necessary to check if the candidate has accepted a voluntary redundancy -> i4:If the candidate has not accepted, the process continues. -> i6:The recruitment manager sends an Appointment Approval form, which is then received by the next level manager. -> i7:If the manager is an external resource, they may not authorize the form.

Addition
- [N2] Added trace (model 1): init(i1) -> action(n2,"advise unsuccessful candidates") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n4,"check if terms and conditions need to be sorted out") -> action(n5,"check if the candidate has accepted a voluntary redundancy") -> branch(b2,XOR) -> action(n6,"the process continues") -> converge(c1) -> action(n8,"send Appointment Approval form") -> action(n9,"received by next level manager") -> branch(b3,XOR) -> action(n10,"If the manager is an external resource") -> action(n11,"they may not authorize the form") -> converge(c2) -> action(n15,"scan and record form in GovSource") -> branch(b4,XOR) -> action(n16,"create business case") -> converge(c3) -> branch(b5,XOR) -> action(n18,"arrange and complete medical assessment (21 days)") -> converge(c4) -> action(n20,"inform recruitment manager and liaise with HR representative") -> branch(b6,XOR) -> action(n21,"contact next candidate on shortlist") -> converge(c5) -> action(n23,"make formal verbal offer to candidate") -> branch(b7,XOR) -> action(n24,"create formal written offer") -> converge(c6) -> action(n26,"send commencement pack and letter of appointment") -> action(n27,"candidate receives documents") -> branch(b8,XOR) -> action(n28,"renegotiate terms") -> branch(b9,XOR) -> action(n30,"continue process") -> converge(c8) -> converge(c9) -> end(e1)
